    "diagnosis": "Intracranial mesenchymal tumour, FET::CREB fusion&ndash;positive",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The morphological spectrum is wide. This example of an <em>EWRS1</em>::<em>ATF1</em> fusion&ndash;positive tumour shows cords of small, cytologically uniform cells.",
    "source": "Arie Perry",
    "copyright": "",
